EhQQ7kNvwGYWljA&_nc_oc=Adqn36t0hHghJgAf4_m-PR-W3Pu6mdnpRC_1kw13qoR9MOJCaTdhXR8srQaj5N12ecI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7_E0EMreJQ8i9GiyBoJpfln28HwhH7EpOPKCHpg4j8WA&oe=6A1EE157"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1158447621850397", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035353_1158447625183730_6458765565871963951_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VqsuFUB6eYgQ7kNvwHs7LY3&_nc_oc=AdrMMvoNHMP3qo3T0Zzg364CT0d_x69IZGBywV5pgNuvvlhXKFsuRHFq1QN6OOvE14s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Hph06PHEv2cklYkZT86XkkoWh8m9lQjJ7DDr5mxAqpw&oe=6A1EDF61"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "430710953030699", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982609_430710956364032_6150975977529824521_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7gpRcL6NagoQ7kNvwF8ljAj&_nc_oc=AdqXRMtBlULug_lu5_PH7fMOQg4WUeMk3--tlPLwIKgWPb73zza4-pGRpvX6gCbwsMM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5prkSMr47nWX53-ZVf0EzOvRRvsE4UlbT0Ej2rl-CrDw&oe=6A1ECD97"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "837774275033767", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982616_837774278367100_4897090437410338032_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=vAzDu1528IIQ7kNvwHfBHv8&_nc_oc=AdoCJimxGAOafNkB2NL1-6DtCOxQi6neLRdONIFbfq6rFXF43x0WBWWorc5XbhQFQjI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7NbS1YyRzlhjrvdeQeU_-8-Ncu0gdisPLYDdPXMHkZdw&oe=6A1ED422"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "land-2560x1440.png", "id": "801538871433377", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984470_801538874766710_7104644288614866285_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c4RiOKLvcgkQ7kNvwFYFzIZ&_nc_oc=AdpFhi5ijuQ0rG1LrC8-RO4KJoL633iS01igL51_NVs22uF5YE2sEKcR5ALDDJ20iho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af60ewSyVd-wrZxl3XlXFHvMWFklJcgCe5R2rc-O0RI6wQ&oe=6A1EF8AE"}, "display_name": "shadow", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Travel through a series of increasingly complex levels, each designed to test your ability to visualize and manipulate 3D structures in a VR environment. With intuitive controls, you can directly interact with the cube and tubes, manipulating them with precision to create clear paths that abide by the rules.\nShadow is not just a game; it's a brain-teasing journey that unfolds within a minimalist, visually stunning universe that evolves as you progress. Each successful connection not only brings satisfaction but also unlocks new levels and complexities. This game ensures that every solution is a burst of dopamine as you see your spatial reasoning skills visibly improve.\nImmersive VR Experience: Feel the thrill of manipulating complex 3D puzzles in a fully immersive VR environment.\nChallenging Gameplay: Master the art of connecting points without intersection, crafting a continuous path through various angles and perspectives.\nProgressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles increase in complexity, offering endless hours of engaging gameplay.\nEducational and Fun: Perfect for puzzle enthusiasts and those looking to sharpen their spatial thinking and geometry skills.\n\nPrepare to stretch your mind and enjoy a unique blend of puzzle-solving and construction in Shadow, where every level is a new opportunity to prove your ingenious problem-solving prowess in the virtual world!", "short_description": "Embark on a mesmerizing puzzle adventure in the virtual world of Shadow, where logic and creativity intertwine. Dive into an immersive experience where you must connect the vertices of a seemingly simple cube using tubes based on orthographic projections. But there's a twist\u2014ensure the tubes do not intersect and remain continuous, challenging your spatial awareness and problem-solving skills."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://digitalsolutions.mn/policy.html", "developer